            "body": "Nice, thanks! Does this close https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/39438 ? \r\n\r\nAnything we should say about this in news.txt?\r\n\r\nLooks like a lateral move in terms of code cost, but fixes a lot and centralizes stuff in the Capability framework.\r\n\r\nbtw, are you noticing any opportunities to improve the Capability abstraction? Ideally it would result in each feature requiring less code.",
